# 行尾统一：仓库内文本文件一律按 LF 存储，检出时按平台/类型转换。
# 目的：消除 Windows 上 autocrlf 带来的 LF↔CRLF 警告与跨平台 diff 噪声。
* text=auto

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF（现场编辑器/记事本多为 CRLF）
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Unix 脚本保持 LF
*.sh  text eol=lf
tools/mvn text eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.jar  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
